<title>UK: UK's Jarvis Hotels buys London hotel.</title>
<headline>UK's Jarvis Hotels buys London hotel.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Jarvis Hotels Plc said on Monday it bought the Carnarvon Hotel in west London for 13.5 million stg cash.</p>
<p>Jarvis said the freehold hotel on Ealing Common had 176 bedrooms, conference and banqueting facilities, and planning permission for a further 39 bedrooms.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
